{"id":"merced","lemma":"merced","pos":"noun","rank":3350,"glosses":["mercy"],"ipa":"/meɾˈθed/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"mercedes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ae/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-merced.wav","formAudio":{"mercedes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e2/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Rub%C3%BD%C3%B1-Mercedes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Si su merced quiere, iremos.","en":"If you want to, we'll go.","words":[{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null,{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"}]},{"text":"El barco estaba a merced de la tormenta.","en":"The ship was at the mercy of the storm.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"boat"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to"},null,null,null,{"g":"storm"}],"phrases":[[5,7,"of the"]]},{"text":"Los marineros estaban a la merced del tiempo.","en":"The sailors were at the mercy of the weather.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/693825","words":[{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"sailor, seaman","l":"marinero"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[6,8,"room-temperature"]]},{"text":"La pobre gente estaba a la merced del cruel dictador.","en":"The poor people were at the mercy of the cruel dictator.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"poor"},{"g":"people"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of the"},{"g":"cruel"},{"g":"dictator"}]}]}